Maintenance note
----------------

This plugin depends on DSH's plugin-record API (`appendPluginRecord`). DSH
documents that API for packages under `packages/experimental/`; it is not an
official stability promise for external plugins, so DSH upgrades may require
follow-up changes in this repository.

